<text matrix="1 0 0 1 0 -112" pin="h" transformations="translations" pos="0 524" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="920" height="69.5268" depth="55.692" valign="top" style="itemize">\item Dynamic Programming by exploring the space of reachable board configurations - this yields running time exponential in graph size $|V|$.
\item Empty Hexasort is positive if $G$ contains a $|C|$ non-overlapping specific spider graphs.</text>
