<text matrix="1 0 0 1 0 -112" pin="h" transformations="translations" pos="0 270.781" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="920" height="53.5892" depth="39.704" valign="top" style="itemize">\item Fitting Hexasort is FPT when parameterized by $|C|$ and $t$. \\
By handling P-time solvable instances first, we restrict the analysis to large graphs with bounded degree and small vertex cover.</text>
</page>
